Package: scr3way
Type: Package
Title: Simultaneous Clustering and Reduction for Three-Way Data
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Diogo", "Ribeiro", email = "diogo_dj@hotmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements simultaneous clustering and dimensionality reduction
    methods for three-way data, including the Gaussian SCR models described by
    Rocci, Vichi and Ranalli (2025) <doi:10.1007/s00180-024-01478-1>.
    The package provides three-way and vectorized SCR estimators, simulation
    and validation utilities, Tucker3 centroid reduction, structural model
    selection, stability diagnostics, covariance-separability extensions,
    sparse loading projections, and Student-t robustness diagnostics.
